2e𐠷\ud802𐠫𐠰𐠰𐠤\ud802\ud802  \udc30 \udc27\udc31\udc30\udc21𐠅𐠫\udc18 \udc22𐠥\udc33𐠩𐠣 \udc2d𐠎\ud802𐠠𐠴\ud802𐠖𐠜</div>"},{"id":"marker171","name":"Westretown Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡰᢏᡟᢦᠽᡔᢛ᠐ᡎ᠑ᠪᢑᢑᠲᢏᡟᢜᠦᢟ᠒ᡯᢐᡭᡕᠲᡆᢏᠰᠼᡁᠰᠳᠿᢁᡴᠧᡒᢑᢜᡙᢋᡆᡍᠾᡭᢓᡳᠾ</div>"},{"id":"marker172","name":"Albridge Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༇༇༅༚༲༠༤་ༀ༅༺༐༙༼༮༒༬༄༢༭༇༙༼༂༁ༀༀ༇༠༿༜༤༧༿༰༑༲༄༛༔༰༬༺༥༐༑༭༧༻༨༶༜༼༣༿༛༣༿༤༶༵༭༥</div>"},{"id":"marker173","name":"Persle Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802𐠩\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠌𐠐\udc21𐠡\udc20\udc1e\udc17\udc28\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠪\udc0b\udc1a𐠞\ud802\ud802𐠗\udc28\ud802 \ud802𐠋\ud802𐠡\udc11𐠡𐠛\udc18\udc3c \udc13\ud802𐠜\ud802𐠥\udc27\udc1e𐠑\udc05𐠦\udc22\udc0f</div>"},{"id":"marker174","name":"Tarton Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> Ⳬ⳪ⳢⲴ ⳪ⳁⳌⲼⲼ⳪ⲶⳌ⳥ⳤ⳥ⲾⲴⳞⳒⳔⳌⳲⳚⳚ⳹ⳜⳆ⳪ⳠⳂⳔⳃⳁ⳧ⳆⳞⳎ Ⲵ⳾ⳞⳲⳊⳆⳔⳊ⳪ⲲⲶⲺⳄ Ⳮ ⳆⳈ ⳔⳎⳚⳌⳬⳠⲺ⳹ Ⳅⳬ⳪ⳆⳖⳁⳌⳖⳤ⳧⳧ⳲⳤⳒⲼⳌⳁⳆⳤⲲⳃ</div>"},{"id":"marker175","name":"Altondone Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳎⳆ Ⲷ⳩ⳆⳠ⳪Ⳇ ⳤⲴⳃⲴ ⳔⳖⳔⳂⲺⳊⲲⳭⳞⳀⳭⳊⳌⲲⲶⳬⳃⳫ⳪ⳌⳖⳈⳀⳊⳎⳘⳜⳀ⳥⳾ⲶⳔⳐⳚⲾⲸⳤⳆⳊⲺⲸⲼⳞⳄⳔⳃ ⳌⲶ⳹  ⳃⳲⳄⳞ Ⳝ</div>"},{"id":"marker176","name":"Craftesdon Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc22\udc0f\udc14\ud802𐠃\ud802\ud802 𐠍\ud802\ud802𐠘𐠓\udc2a\ud802𐠈𐠊\udc2d\ud802𐠚\udc16𐠂 \ud802𐠬\ud802𐠦𐠢\udc38\ud802𐠌𐠂\ud802𐠓𐠒\udc17\udc2e𐠁𐠼\udc2b𐠄𐠎𐠂𐠄\udc15\udc1c</div>"},{"id":"marker177","name":"D