𐠘\ud802\ud802𐠲\ud802 \udc34\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker183","name":"Congdon Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༡༁༿༻༡ༀ༬༊༺༅༉༪༗༭༼༜༡༿༸༱༆༶༈༦༒༷༉༪༙༱༾་༼༉༰༱༮༺༦༨༣༴༡༈༡༣ༀ༧༴༅༠༥༈༶ༀ་༒ༀ༿༴༛༕༯༂༚༢༾༖༬༈༵༵༜༆༮༇༡༙༜༕༅༸༶༱༼༔༮༙༜༑༻༢</div>"},{"id":"marker184","name":"Kendone Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">᠒ᠱᡍᠠᠻᢐᠱᡮᠰᢒᠼᡜᢀ᠒ᡠᢂᡓᠩᢑᢡᡠᡡᢂᡙᢓᢁᡞᡲᠲᠾᡆᢠᡍᡰᡮᢟᠭᠱᠵᠧᢏᡎᡱᡙᡜ</div>"},{"id":"marker185","name":"Treley Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802𐠯\udc0f\udc21 \udc03\udc01𐠊\udc37\udc11\udc2f\ud802𐠨\udc28\ud802 𐠝 \udc28 \udc32\ud802𐠠\udc1c\udc0f𐠿𐠘\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠖\ud802𐠚\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠟\udc0a\udc1a𐠒\ud802\ud802 \udc03\udc1b\ud802\ud802𐠚\ud802𐠿\udc2b\ud802\ud802𐠡𐠿\udc0f\udc35\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠴\udc0c\udc37\udc23\udc2f\udc12\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠠𐠭\udc23\ud802\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker186","name":"Balneley Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፀኀሐደቀዐፈገ ኀሰጰደሰፈበ አተየ ዐየአፐረጸረነ ወሐሰጰተሠሐዘጸረከቀሀ ዘሠረሀጸ ነጠበደአነፐ ሀቀዘዐሀደጠ ሀ ፐዐነሐለገገሐ  ኀከ  </div>"},{"id":"marker187","name":"Atbury Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ረመፐየደሰፐቀሐፀዐጰረዘኀቀሰኀጰበአመሰረነሠፐ ከቀገጸወሀጸመቀየደፀሠጠበአሐከመሀዐኀኀአወጰሠ ፐዘተነአገሰነሀረጰለደዐገመሐሀጰአየሰ</div>"},{"id":"marker188","name":"Brampsea Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳃⲶ⳾⳪ⳄⳆ⳧⳥Ⳮ⳧ⳔⳐⳜ⳩ⲼⳀⲸⳢ⳥ⳁⳫⳈⳞⳜⳆⳄⳄⲲⳞⲺⳞⳢⳄⳂ⳥⳪ⳤⳫ⳾ⳈⲺⳲⳎⲾⳆⳊ⳧ⳞⳫⲾⳬⳤⲴⲸⲺⳆ⳾ⳆⳘⳲ⳪ⳔⳃⳲ ⳂⳀⳊⳲⳈⳖⳐⳞⲲⳲⳜⳬ</div>"},{"id":"marker189","name":"Guildgerexe Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡴᡍᡆᢡᢋᠲᡁ᠒ᠼᡭᡒᠰᡠᢢ᠀ᢋᢤᠯᠦᡆᠼᢏᠪᠠᢜᡎᠮᡕᡖᠡᡯᡜᡮᠡᡲᠿᠩᡍᠠᡍᢞᠠᢑᠿ᠒ᡁᢥᡏᠼᠿᠼᢏᠩᡙᠠᠽᢑ</div>"},{"id":"marker190","name":"Portsfield Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠴𐠜\ud802𐠮\udc17\udc1f\ud802\ud802𐠜\udc27\udc03𐠂\udc21\ud802 \udc16\udc26\udc16\udc0c\ud802𐠬 \ud802𐠐\ud802 \udc0b𐠪𐠂\ud802\ud802𐠄 \udc19 𐠮𐠳 \udc35\udc2f𐠊𐠠 \udc37𐠞\ud802𐠃𐠯\udc1f\udc10𐠵\udc33\udc21\ud802𐠈\udc29</div>"},{"id":"marker191","name":"Gathampound Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳔⲴ ⲺⳁⳬⳂ⳩ⳲⲾⳌⳔ ⳤⳎ⳾ⳤⲾⳤ⳾Ⳉ⳧ⳞⲲⲴ⳾⳹ⳠⲶⳂⳂⳊⳠⳚⳬⳭⳭⲺⳠⳄ⳧⳹ⳌⳔⳫ Ⲻ⳧Ⳍ Ⲿⳃ⳾Ⲻ</div>"},{"id":"marker192","name":"Bostony Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ከአፈፈጰረበከኀበገሐተወፐበፀአዐፀፈገረሐዐ ሰ ደየጸከፐ ሠ ፈኀዐፐጠወደዘሀኀነ በለበፐከገፀረረተቀፀገ ዘፐረሰየረከዘፐበአየ ፐደፐነ ጠበደ ሐ</div>"},{"id":"marker193","name":"Wickburgh Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳗ ⳩⳪ⳁⲾⳂ⳩⳪ⳌⳞ  ⳎⲴ ⳢⲶ⳾ⳫⳂⳲⲼⳬ ⳂⳒⳔⳚⳔⳲⲼⳎⲶⲶⳚⳊⳠ Ⳝ ⳥Ⳓ ⳠⲸⲼⳜ⳹ ⳤⳘ⳥⳹ⳢⳂⳃ⳪Ⳳ⳧ⳆⳘ</div>"},{"id":"marker194","name":"Marlworthel Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳖⲴⳭⲶⲼⳄ⳾⳥ⳊⳊ Ⳝ⳾ⳲⳭ⳥ⳫⳌⳆⳢⳜⳤⳲⲼⲸ⳹ⳫⲾⳂⲲⳠ   ⳫⲺ⳩ⲴⳠⲶⳌⲲⳘⳤⳂ ⳖⳐⲶⲺ ⳹ⲴⳄⳀⳄⳜ⳥ⳞⳃⳢⳲⳘⳜ⳾ⳐⳚⳘⳐⳒⳂ⳩ⳬⳲⳲ⳾⳪ⳂⳘ ⳬⳌⳃ⳾ⲶⲼ⳾ⲴⳤⲲ⳩</div>"},{"id":"marker195","name":"Dodbrid Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠈𐠃𐠪\ud802𐠩𐠣\udc21\ud802𐠕𐠪\udc14\udc32 \udc2e \udc1a𐠤\udc28\ud802\ud802𐠱𐠠\udc22