 boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker266","name":"Ravens migration","legend":"A huge group of ravens are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker267","name":"Hounds migration","legend":"A huge group of hounds are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker268","name":"Oxen migration","legend":"A huge group of oxen are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker269","name":"Mantises migration","legend":"A huge group of mantises are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker270","name":"Sheep migration","legend":"A huge group of sheep are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker271","name":"Buffalo migration","legend":"A huge group of buffalo are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker272","name":"Axbridge jubilee","legend":"A jubilee has been organised at Axbridge as a chance to gather the spiritual leaders of the area together to be merry, make alliances and scheme around the crisis."},{"id":"marker273","name":"Distant mirage","legend":"This distant mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker274","name":"Mantacury Fracture","legend":"The Mantacury Fracture. Locals claim that it is totally empty."},{"id":"marker275","name":"Bamersin Cave","legend":"The Bamersin Cave. Locals claim that it is a good spot to hid treasure."},{"id":"marker276","name":"Tihulbowen Cavern","legend":"The Tihulbowen Cavern. Locals claim that it is a good spot to hid treasure."},{"id":"marker277","name":"Waringleroe Cavern","legend":"The Waringleroe Cavern. Locals claim that it is slowly filling with lava."},{"id":"marker278","name":"Orlisfield Graveyard","legend":"A desolate necropolis where an eerie stillness reigns. Time seems frozen amidst the decaying mausoleums, and the silence is broken only by the whispers of the wind and the rustle of tattered banners."},{"id":"marker279","name":"Helston Necropolis","legend":"A foreboding necropolis perched atop a jagged cliff, overlooking a desolate wasteland. Its towering walls harbor restless spirits, and the imposing gates bear the marks of countless battles and ancient curses."},{"id":"marker280","name":"Durleigh Mausoleum","legend":"A sprawling necropolis built within a labyrinthine network of catacombs. Its halls are lined with countless alcoves, each housing the remains of the departed, while the distant sound of rattling bones fills the air."},{"id":"marker281","name":"Dunstabrid Tomb","legend":"This cursed necropolis is veiled in perpetual twilight, perpetuating a sense of impending doom. Dark enchantments shroud the tombs, and the moans of anguished souls resound through its crumbling halls."},{"id":"marker282","name":"Knamerster Mausoleum","legend":"A labyrinthine necropolis where each step echoes with haunting murmurs. The walls are adorned with ancient runes, and restless spirits guide or hinder those who dare to delve into its depths."},{"id":"marker283","name":"Harmouth Sepulchre","legend":"A sprawling necropolis built within a labyrinthine network of catacombs. Its halls are lined with countless alcoves, each housing the remains of the departed, while the distant sound of rattling bones fills the air."},{"id":"marker284","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/55344\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker285","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/36915\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts all